4,imgsize-53670.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[US judge rules DHS cannot threaten citizen with prosecution over criticism of ICE chief]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134294040.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-judge-rules-dhs-cannot-threaten-citizen-with-prosecution-over-criticism-of-ice-chief/articleshow/134294040.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-judge-rules-dhs-cannot-threaten-citizen-with-prosecution-over-criticism-of-ice-chief/articleshow/134294040.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-16T23:27:16+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134294137,imgsize-97511.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Syria's parliament votes to scrap Assad-era terrorism court, nullify rulings]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134293903.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Syria's parliament voted to abolish a counter-terrorism court established in 2012. This court was reportedly used to prosecute thousands of anti-Assad Syrians on terrorism charges. The decision formalizes the court's abolition after new authorities treated it as defunct. The United Nations Human Rights Committee had raised concerns over judicial guarantees and fair trials. This vote occurred after opposition forces removed Bashar al-Assad from power in December 2024.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/syrias-parliament-votes-to-scrap-assad-era-terrorism-court-nullify-rulings/articleshow/134293903.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/syrias-parliament-votes-to-scrap-assad-era-terrorism-court-nullify-rulings/articleshow/134293903.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-16T23:21:19+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Pranjal Pandey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134294008,imgsize-104408.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Trump admin paid $9.5 billion to federal workers to stay home in 2025: Report]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134293631.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/trump-admin-paid-9-5-billion-to-federal-workers-to-stay-home-in-2025-report/articleshow/134293631.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/trump-admin-paid-9-5-billion-to-federal-workers-to-stay-home-in-2025-report/articleshow/134293631.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-16T23:11:13+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Gokul Ankari</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134293807,imgsize-1203779.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Meet Praadhyumn Indaana, 17, whose AI cut nuclear heat-limit error from 63% to 5.5%; he won $50K]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134265837.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Praadhyumn Indaana has created a groundbreaking physics-guided neural network tailored for nuclear reactors. This cutting-edge model has significantly lowered prediction errors associated with critical heat flux, providing enhanced insights into reactor operating parameters. His remarkable achievement not only secured him a substantial scholarship but also garnered him noteworthy recognition, showcasing the immense capabilities of AI in addressing intricate scientific engineering problems.]]></description><l